sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Human
    participant O as Orchestrator<br/>(zerg skill)
    participant F as swarm.py<br/>+ .swarm/goal + git
    participant E as examiner role
    participant W as worker role<br/>(worktree)
    participant V as verifier role<br/>(read-only)

    H->>O: use zerg on "goal in plain language"
    O->>F: onboard: clean tree, base, run suite (green)
    O->>F: write contract.md, plan.md
    O->>H: INTERRUPT approve? (contract, questions, units)
    H-->>O: approve (answers amend the contract)
    O->>F: checkout -b swarm/goal, commit plan
    O->>E: Goal, MAIN
    E->>F: unit tests (committed) + holdout (gitignored)
    E-->>O: check command per unit, holdout command
    O->>F: baseline: every unit check fails

    loop until every unit is merged or stuck
        O->>F: lease ready units (after satisfied), commit
        par one per ready unit
            O->>W: Goal, Unit, MAIN
            W->>F: read contract + own plan row (note, scope)
            W->>F: branch unit/goal/U, edit scope, commit
            W-->>O: RESULT produced | escalated | gave_up
        end
        O->>F: confirm commits exist (never trust the report)
        O->>F: check: diff paths in scope, unit tests pass in temp worktree
        par one per checked unit
            O->>V: Goal, Unit, MAIN
            V->>F: read diff, contract, trace untested inputs
            V-->>O: VERDICT PASS | FAIL
        end
        O->>F: tree clean? merge PASS units, run suite
        O->>F: revise failures: note, revisions+1 (stuck on 3rd or repeat)
        opt stuck units
            O->>H: INTERRUPT one question per stuck unit
            H-->>O: answer / drop / stop
        end
    end

    O->>F: integrate: suite + holdout (pass/fail only)
    O->>V: Goal, whole, MAIN
    V-->>O: blocking / advisory findings
    O->>F: prove: every criterion mapped to evidence
    O->>F: learn.md proposals, commit
    O->>H: hand off: branch, diff stat, evidence, findings
    H->>F: review and merge swarm/goal
